message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Calibration of AI Weather Models Using Machine Learning"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Idrissi Meliani"
    given-names: "Hamza"
    affiliation: "Hassania School of Public Works (EHTP)"
date-released: 2026-10-11
license: MIT
keywords:
  - weather forecast calibration
  - bias correction
  - AI weather models
  - statistical post-processing
  - machine learning
  - Morocco
abstract: >-
  Evaluation and machine-learning bias correction of eight AI weather models
  (AIFS, Aurora, DLWP, FengWu, FourCastNet, FuXi, GraphCast, Pangu6) at 34
  Moroccan stations. Temperature RMSE is reduced by 14.7% to 44.7% on a
  time-ordered test set. Internship carried out at the General Directorate of
  Meteorology of Morocco (DGM).
